     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Support the implementation of integrated Sustainability Roadmap at the national level and internal capacity building of ADSD team. 
- Support key transformative policies to accelerate achievement of SDGs based on pre-set criteria, including by developing enhanced policy framework for prioritized SDG acceleration per year. 
- The Accelerator Lab will provide advisory/knowledge support to the creation of the &#x201c;SDGs Innovative Solution in KSA Platform&#x201d; by creating the specifications in collaboration with partners and learning from global best practices through workshops. The Accelerator lab will provide. 
- Data Gap Analysis to Identify main gaps in terms of data and potential sources to collect missing data conducted. 

- (Work with SDGs department in other government (GASTAT &#x2013; SDAIA &#x2013; ADAA as stakeholders) and for Data and Monitoring covers two main sets of indicators:

1.	SDG global framework 
2.	SDSN

- Define methodology for data collection and define roles and responsibilities. 
- Develop/ update metadata for the SDGs (3 SDG Tiers) and the national indicators with manual for data production and roles and responsibilities. 

- Update the national indicators/ the SDGs indicators (continuously). 

- Develop/ implement a statistic capacity development action plan for the statistical system (entities outside GASTAT such as line ministries) in line with international standards. 

- Provide support to the preparation of KSA SDG Progress Reports. 
- Carry-out the Voluntary National Review.
- Develop the medium-term Expenditure Framework (MTEF) macro model and assess its accuracy. 
- preparation of fiscal frameworks and macroeconomic analysis and modelling. 
- Support in financial management design, model design and development of FPPs, MTFF, MTBF and MTEF. 
- Support in preparing fiscal frameworks and undertaking macroeconomic analysis and modelling.
- Submit policy recommendation to develop the contribution of the private sector in each economic sector.
- Support in developing policies dedicated to specific regions. 
- Deliver training courses about developing regional policies.
- Develop a standard policy framework to develop regional policies. 
- Grow an understanding of social policies in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia and deliver adapted social policies to reach the objective outlined in Vision 2030.
- Delivering customized technical course on Macroeconomics.
- Delivering 4 customized technical courses per year. Topics included: fiscal, newcomers package, quantitative analysis, statistics, policy assessment, trade exports. Courses to entail knowledge transfer components such as TOT. 
